  "description": "After losing his mother, Jun-Yeong was practically raised by his older step-brother, Jun-Won. Though once inseparable, their close bond fractured when Jun-Won hit adolescence, leaving them as distant as strangers. But during Jun-Yeong's final year of high school, everything abruptly shifts. The unspoken boundary between brothers suddenly begins to blur, turning a forgotten connection into a dark, obsessive desire where line crossing becomes unavoidable.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
